---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Peptides Rx — My4MLife';
const description = 'Telemedicine consult to evaluate you for our peptide portfolio — repair, performance, cognitive, metabolic, and longevity peptides.';
const canonical = 'https://www.my4mlife.com/rx/peptides';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>

<section class="rx-section">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-eyebrow">Peptides · Tissue Repair · Cognitive · Metabolic · Longevity</p>
    <h1>Peptides are the most precise tool in regenerative medicine. Used correctly, they change outcomes.</h1>

    <p class="rx-lead">
      Peptides are short chains of amino acids that signal specific biological processes — tissue repair, growth hormone release, mitochondrial function, immune modulation, cognitive performance, fat-loss pathways, sleep architecture. They are not supplements. They are clinical-grade biological signals that have to be matched to your goals, evaluated by a physician, and dosed correctly.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-body">
      Our peptide portfolio covers the categories the literature supports most strongly: <strong>BPC-157</strong> and <strong>TB-500</strong> for tissue and gut repair. <strong>CJC-1295 / Ipamorelin</strong>, <strong>Sermorelin</strong>, and <strong>Tesamorelin</strong> for growth-hormone-axis support, lean mass, and visceral-fat reduction. <strong>Semax</strong> and <strong>Selank</strong> for cognitive resilience and mood. <strong>Thymosin Alpha-1</strong> for immune support. <strong>DSIP</strong> for sleep. <strong>MOTS-c</strong> and <strong>Epitalon</strong> for metabolic and longevity signaling. Others available based on your evaluation.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-body">
      Your telemedicine consult is a focused conversation about what you're trying to achieve — accelerated injury recovery, growth-hormone-axis decline, cognitive performance, fat loss, sleep, broader anti-aging — and the physician maps you to the peptide or combination that fits. <strong>One consult. One or multiple peptides depending on what the physician writes.</strong> Peptides ship direct from our regulated compounding partner after the script is written.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-price-line">
      <strong>Free</strong> — telemedicine consult with a physician in our network. No lab work required.
      <span class="rx-pay-note">Peptide costs are billed separately by the partner after the physician writes your script.</span>
    </p>

    <a class="rx-cta-btn" href="/rx/peptides/questionnaire">
      Schedule Your Free Consult &rarr;
    </a>

    <p class="rx-disclosure">
      Submit the form on the next page and our care coordinator will email you within 24 hours to schedule your telemedicine consult with the appropriate physician in our network.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.rx-section { padding: calc(76px + 3.5rem) 1rem 5rem; min-height: 60vh; }
.rx-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 1.25rem; }
.rx-eyebrow { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
.rx-inner h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--primary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.18; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.62; margin: 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-body strong { color: var(--primary); }
.rx-price-line { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--primary); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.55; }
.rx-price-line strong { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.35rem; }
.rx-pay-note { display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.35rem; }
.rx-cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,184,148,0.25); transition: opacity .15s; }
.rx-cta-btn:hover { opacity: 0.92; }
.rx-disclosure { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
